# Next.js + UI

- App Router only (`app/`). No Pages Router.
- TypeScript strict. Server Components by default; `"use client"` only when interactivity is needed.
- API routes live under `app/api/**/route.ts`. Keep `route.ts` thin — business logic in `lib/`.
- All APIs require admin auth. Names (files, vars, functions) in English.
- UI: Tailwind + shadcn/ui. Avoid custom CSS. Do not add MUI/Chakra.

```tsx
// ✅ Server Component fetching data
export default async function TopicsPage() {
  const topics = await prisma.topic.findMany();
  return <TopicList topics={topics} />;
}

// ❌ Client fetch for data the server already has
"use client";
useEffect(() => { fetch("/api/topics").then(...) }, []);
```

Playground (M4+): query + filters, retrieved chunks **and** answer side by side, editable system prompt. M8: base vs fine-tuned toggle and comparison.
